-------------------

Maia 3 source code and the Maia3-5M checkpoint are provided by the University
of Toronto CSSLab under GNU AGPL-3.0.

Official source: https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3
Official model: https://huggingface.co/UofTCSSLab/Maia3-5M
Vendored source revision: 1e13597c42d4858b7cfd7cfdae01e297263364b2
